@startuml sequence-place-bid
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Figure 5 — Place bid, including the race-condition path

actor Bidder
participant "React UI\n(BidForm)" as UI
participant "Express\n(auth + validate)" as API
participant BiddingService as S
database MongoDB as DB

Bidder -> UI : 1. enter amount, Place bid
UI -> API : 2. POST /api/auctions/:id/bids\n{ amount } + JWT
API -> API : 3. requireAuth, validate(bidSchema)
API -> S : 4. placeBid({auctionId, bidderId, amount})
S -> DB : 5. Auction.findById(id)
DB --> S : auction (bidCount = n)
S -> S : 6. check BR-06, BR-05, BR-07, BR-03/04
alt all rules pass and no one bid in between
  S -> DB : 7. findOneAndUpdate({_id, status:ACTIVE,\nendTime > now, bidCount: n},\n{$set currentBid, highestBidder; $inc bidCount})
  DB --> S : updated auction (bidCount = n + 1)
  S -> DB : 8. Bid.create({auction, bidder, amount})
  S --> API : { auction, bid }
  API --> UI : 201 Created
else rule broken, or another bid won the race (update matched nothing)
  S --> API : AppError 409 (BID_TOO_LOW / OUTBID_RETRY / ...)
  API --> UI : 409 { error: { code, message, details } }
end
UI --> Bidder : 9. show result
@enduml
